rt of the Five Deeps Expedition.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2019-05-15","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:Vlvescovo&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Vlvescovo (page does not exist)\">Vlvescovo</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""}}}]},"120539957":{"pageid":120539957,"ns":6,"title":"File:Dr Dawn Wright and CDR Victor Vescovo Challenger Deep Dive 071222 Western Pool-1.jpg","index":3,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":657034,"width":1920,"height":1080,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/Dr_Dawn_Wright_and_CDR_Victor_Vescovo_Challenger_Deep_Dive_071222_Western_Pool-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":1800,"thumbheight":1013,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/Dr_Dawn_Wright_and_CDR_Victor_Vescovo_Challenger_Deep_Dive_071222_Western_Pool-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1800,"height":1013},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/Dr_Dawn_Wright_and_CDR_Victor_Vescovo_Challenger_Deep_Dive_071222_Western_Pool-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dr_Dawn_Wright_and_CDR_Victor_Vescovo_Challenger_Deep_Dive_071222_Western_Pool-1.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=120539957","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"This photo was taken inside the control capsule of the submersible DSV Limiting Factor during a dive to 10,919 meters +/ 6 meters on July 12, 2022 in the Western Pool of Challenger Deep.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value